    "CoiStatement": "MM and JM are employees of Boston Health Economics, Inc. MF is a former employee of Boston Health Economics, Inc. Boston Health Economics, Inc., received funding from EMD Serono, Inc., Rockland, MA, USA (a business of Merck KGaA, Darmstadt, Germany) to conduct the analyses. ALP is an employee of EMD Serono, Inc., Rockland, MA, USA (a business of Merck KGaA, Darmstadt, Germany). The authors received no funding for their participation in the writing of the manuscript. The authors report no other conflicts of interest in this work.",
